---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Why Choose Link Wave Global Study | Expert Education Consultancy"
  description="Discover why Link Wave Global Study is Nepal's trusted partner for international education. Expert counseling, visa processing, and test preparation for Australia, UK, Canada, USA, Japan & more."
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="reveal">Why Choose <span class="highlight">Link Wave?</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle reveal">Your Trusted Partner for International Education Since Inception</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Who We Are -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="who-we-are reveal">
        <span class="section-label">Who We Are</span>
        <h2>Link Wave Global Study</h2>
        <p class="lead">An initiative of <strong>Mira Group</strong>, Link Wave prides itself for being the best option one can have for study abroad plans. We provide assistance from planning your study destination to preparing and processing for it.</p>
        <p>Run and managed by veterans of the education industry, we offer visa processing to <strong>Australia, Canada, Japan, UK, New Zealand, India and European countries</strong>. Most students these days prefer going to different countries that are more developed in educational and infrastructural aspects, due to various factors. On having an overview on abroad study options, one can see that there are plenty. Some destinations might be appropriate for some students and some might not.</p>
        <p>We have an experienced team of Counselors and visa processing officers who have been in the field for <strong>more than a decade</strong> who not only assist you on test preparation and processing but also on the most crucial part, course and destination selection. The initial part for any study abroad procedure is the language test. We offer a range of language and aptitude test preparation (<strong>IELTS, PTE, JLCT/JLPT/JFT</strong>) with all the required study materials. Our team of instructors involves professionals who are pioneers in their respective faculties to ensure the best quality of service.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Core Values -->
  <section class="section bg-light">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-label">Our Foundation</span>
        <h2>Core Values & Ethical Principles</h2>
        <p>Our core values tell us, our clients, and the communities we serve, who we really are, what we are about, and the principles by which we pledge to conduct business. In essence, we believe that success can only be achieved by living our core values and principles. Keeping this in mind, we assist students by giving exhaustive information about study opportunities worldwide.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="values-grid">
        <div class="value-card reveal">
          <div class="value-icon">
            <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
              <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Customer Focus</h3>
          <p>Our customer/client is students and parents. At Link Wave Global Study, our prime focus is to perfect our client/customer service. Customers are our first priority and driving force. We wish to gain customer confidence and be their trusted partner.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="value-card reveal">
          <div class="value-icon">
            <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Quality</h3>
          <p>We believe that quality service experience is paramount to our customers and we are strongly committed to fulfilling this ideal with every interaction.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="value-card reveal">
          <div class="value-icon">
            <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Honesty & Integrity</h3>
          <p>We ensure the highest level of integrity to our clients, creating an ongoing relationship of trust and confidence. We treat our customers with honesty, fairness, and respect.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="value-card reveal">
          <div class="value-icon">
            <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/>
              <path d="M7 21v-2a4 4 0 0 1 3-3.87"/>
              <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/>
              <path d="M12 15v3"/>
              <path d="M9 18h6"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Team Work Approach</h3>
          <p>Link Wave Global Study is not a one man show. We believe in teamwork and feel that a loyal and motivated team can produce extraordinary results. We are driven by a performance culture where recognition and rewards are based on individual merit and demonstrated track record. In the next five year policy, the company has planned to open more branches in the major cities of Nepal.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mission, Vision, Goals -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="mvg-grid">
        <div class="mvg-card reveal">
          <h3>Objective</h3>
          <p>Link Wave Global Study aims to provide comprehensive support for students and professionals seeking international education and career opportunities. We simplify the study abroad process through expert counseling, visa assistance, test preparation (IELTS, PTE, Japanese), and scholarship guidance, ensuring a smooth and informed journey.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mvg-card reveal">
          <h3>Vision</h3>
          <p>We aspire to be the market leaders in study abroad guidance by encouraging and empowering globalization of education providers from around the globe, the connect for further academic learning and exchange.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mvg-card reveal">
          <h3>Goals</h3>
          <p>Link Wave Global Study is one of the fastest-growing Education Agencies and is one of the most trusted names for genuine and professional guidance to students for Study Abroad. With a team of Certified and professional counselors, we are ready to hold your hand at every step of your Study Abroad process.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mvg-card reveal">
          <h3>Mission</h3>
          <p>To be a leading educational consultancy delivering world class service through state-of-the-art technology and visionary management in partnership with competent and committed staff, to achieve sound financial health with sustainable value addition to all our stakeholders. We are committed to do this mission while ensuring the highest levels of ethical standards, professional integrity, corporate governance and regulatory compliance.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Leadership -->
  <section class="section bg-light">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-label">Leadership</span>
        <h2>Our Team</h2>
      </div>
      
      <div class="team-card reveal">
        <div class="team-avatar">
          <svg width="80" height="80" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
            <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="team-info">
          <h3>Kapur Thapa</h3>
          <span class="position">CEO, Link Wave Global Study</span>
          <p>Leading our vision to become Nepal's premier education consultancy, Kapur Thapa brings extensive experience and dedication to guiding students toward their international education dreams.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Location -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="location-card reveal">
        <div class="location-icon">
          <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/>
            <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="location-details">
          <h3>Visit Our Head Office</h3>
          <p>Located in <strong>Putalisadak, Kathmandu, Nepal</strong>, our head office serves as a hub for students seeking guidance and support in pursuing international education. We invite you to connect with us to explore the myriad opportunities that await you.</p>
          <p class="tagline">At Link Wave Global Study, we believe in <strong>linking ideas and aspirations to create a brighter future for our students.</strong></p>
          <a href="/contact-us" class="btn btn-primary">Get in Touch</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Section -->
  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container reveal">
      <h2>Ready to Start Your International Education Journey?</h2>
      <p>Let our expert counselors guide you every step of the way</p>
      <div class="cta-buttons">
        <a href="/contact-us" class="btn btn-primary">Contact Us Today</a>
        <a href="tel:+9779851410481" class="btn btn-outline-light">Call Now</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  /* Hero Section */
  .about-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--secondary) 0%, var(--tertiary) 100%);
    color: var(--primary-white);
    padding: 5rem 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-hero h1 {
    color: var(--primary-white);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .highlight {
    color: #ffd700;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* Sections */
  .section {
    padding: 5rem 0;
  }

  .bg-light {
    background: var(--gray-100);
  }

  .section-label {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(101, 45, 144, 0.1);
    color: var(--tertiary);
    padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem;
  }

  .section-header p {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: #555;
  }

  /* Who We Are */
  .who-we-are {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .who-we-are h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .who-we-are .lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--tertiary);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .who-we-are p {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: #444;
  }

  /* Values Grid */
  .values-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .value-card {
    background: var(--primary-white);
    padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    transition: all var(--transition);
    border-top: 4px solid transparent;
  }

  .value-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(36, 54, 120, 0.12);
    border-top-color: var(--tertiary);
  }

  .value-icon {
    color: var(--tertiary);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    background: rgba(101, 45, 144, 0.08);
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .value-card h3 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }

  .value-card p {
    color: #555;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* MVG Grid */
  .mvg-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .mvg-card {
    background: var(--gray-100);
    padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--secondary);
    transition: all var(--transition);
  }

  .mvg-card:hover {
    background: var(--primary-white);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    border-left-color: var(--tertiary);
  }

  .mvg-card h3 {
    color: var(--tertiary);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }

  .mvg-card p {
    color: #555;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* Team Card */
  .team-card {
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: var(--primary-white);
    padding: 3rem;
    border-radius: 16px;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
  }

  .team-avatar {
    width: 100px;
    height: 100px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    background: var(--gray-200);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--secondary);
  }

  .team-info h3 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .position {
    display: block;
    color: var(--tertiary);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .team-info p {
    color: #666;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* Location Card */
  .location-card {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--secondary), var(--tertiary));
    color: var(--primary-white);
    padding: 3rem;
    border-radius: 16px;
  }

  .location-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: #ffd700;
  }

  .location-details h3 {
    color: var(--primary-white);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .location-details p {
    opacity: 0.9;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .tagline {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #ffd700 !important;
    opacity: 1 !important;
    margin-bottom: 2rem !important;
  }

  .location-details .btn-primary {
    background: var(--primary-white);
    color: var(--secondary);
  }

  .location-details .btn-primary:hover {
    background: #ffd700;
    color: var(--secondary);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .location-card {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
    }
    
    .location-icon {
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
  }

  /* CTA Section */
  .cta-section {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--secondary) 0%, var(--tertiary) 100%);
    color: var(--primary-white);
    padding: 4rem 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta-section h2 {
    color: var(--primary-white);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .cta-section p {
    opacity: 0.9;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .cta-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .cta-section .btn-primary {
    background: #ffd700;
    color: var(--secondary);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .cta-section .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--primary-white);
  }

  .btn-outline-light {
    border: 2px solid var(--primary-white);
    color: var(--primary-white);
    padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all var(--transition);
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .btn-outline-light:hover {
    background: var(--primary-white);
    color: var(--secondary);
  }
</style>